        "answer": {
          "short": "38 years",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}I&=PRT\\\\91\\,200&=30\\,000\\times0.08\\times T\\\\91\\,200&=2400T\\\\T&=\\frac{91\\,200}{2400}\\\\T&=38\\text{ years}\\end{align*}$$",
